     llooaaddeerr..lluuaa — bootloader Lua binding module

DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The built-in Lua bindings for the FreeBSD boot loaders using the Lua in‐
     terpreter are available via the llooaaddeerr table.

     The llooaaddeerr table is always available in Lua scripts.  There is no need to
     require it like other loader-specific modules.

