     mmaacchhiinnee__aarrcchh  The target's _h_w_._m_a_c_h_i_n_e___a_r_c_h sysctl(8) value.  Some boot
                   loaders are 32-bit applications that then load a 64-bit
                   kernel.  In these cases, mmaacchhiinnee__aarrcchh represents the 32-bit
                   architecture, not the 64-bit architecture.

     lluuaa__ppaatthh      The current lua loading path.

